<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n38268" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">presso</span></b> , āre, v. freq.
			a.
		premo, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>I.</b><i>to press</i> (<b>poet.</b>): 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">vomicam,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Plaut. Pers. 2, 5, 11</span></i>
			: pressatur pede pes, mucro mucrone, viro vir, Furius Antias
			ap. <i><span class="en">Macr. S. 6, 3</span></i>: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">cineres ad pectora pressant,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Ov. M.
					8, 538</span></i>
			: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">ubera manibus pressanda,</span>”
				i. e. <i>to be milked</i>,
				 <i><span class="en">id.
					ib. 15, 472</span></i>
			; cf.: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">ubera palmis,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Verg.
					E. 3, 99</span></i>
			: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">uvam pede,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Prop.
					3, 15</span></i>
			 (4, 16), 18: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">molliter ubera ovium,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Ambros. Virg. 3, 4, 17</span></i>
			. </div>
